              "type": "text",
              "text": "False",
              "marks": [
                "italic"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " accordingly. If the card is blue, the participant instead considers the statement ‘I do ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "not",
              "marks": [
                "italic"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " regularly cycle to school’ and answers ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "True",
              "marks": [
                "italic"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
